Subject: [PATCH] editor water map: a finer water map for rendering
 (ed_water_hires texels per cell, default 4): bilinear shore flag and exact
 depth per texel, rebuilt for the dirty cells only; the half resolution map of
 the file is untouched

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

